a069ed 3x"}, "body": "I would like for you to draw my cute OC in your artstyle.\nI want a unique shiny bunny girl outfit in your design.\nBunny ears on top of head.\nI want feathers in the bunny girl outfit design.\nColors are red white yellow gold black.\nAnd any other colors are up to you.\n2 big wings on the back like this https://imgur.com/a/qTAFJoB\nHair like this https://imgur.com/a/qTAFJoB\nGlitter in the hair.\nRed hair and Yellow hair like this https://imgur.com/a/qTAFJoB\nEars are wings\nMultiple facial expression, embarrassed, happy, normal,\nI would like differences\nPose and background up to you\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/qTAFJoB", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@H_arcana/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2573003, "client_id": 2330453, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/696a3010/uploads/origins/dd84ff8a-4972-4427-a6a5-3d19a0e12ad4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be7d53352741e4664e556762172029af", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/696a3010/uploads/origins/dd84ff8a-4972-4427-a6a5-3d19a0e12ad4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be7d53352741e4664e556762172029af, https://si.imgix.net/696a3010/uploads/origins/dd84ff8a-4972-4427-a6a5-3d19a0e12ad4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de7f946ac75543deeb4e4764438ea91d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/696a3010/uploads/origins/dd84ff8a-4972-4427-a6a5-3d19a0e12ad4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9e6f4d4488519c6bacd027c37139699 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/696a3010/uploads/origins/dd84ff8a-4972-4427-a6a5-3d19a0e12ad4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e22e2ea897462fc134d383034451d3f2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/696a3010/uploads/origins/dd84ff8a-4972-4427-a6a5-3d19a0e12ad4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e22e2ea897462fc134d383034451d3f2, https://si.imgix.net/696a3010/uploads/origins/dd84ff8a-4972-4427-a6a5-3d19a0e12ad4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fd49be727e7160e59db743364ba0a7c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/696a3010/uploads/origins/dd84ff8a-4972-4427-a6a5-3d19a0e12ad4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=67bf13acd5b4fb4f9e4bb860f7093a01 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I saw your artworks in twitter and I really love your art style!\n\nI would love to request a Valentines Day artwork of my OC.\n\nMinoru is a polar bear alchemist. She is shy, friendly and clumsy.\nPose will be her trying her very best to make chocolates for her friends and the kitchen is in a mess due to her clumsiness.\n\nI also love the artwork you did (https://twitter.com/h_arcana/status/1228298885904261120?s=20&t=IlkQ06OZMfqOqvhw6_IcLw)\n\nI would love to let you decide on the expression and the composition.\nPlease separate the layers as I would love to use it on a schedule.\nI will credit you as well!\n\nThank you in advance!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-R05PhPhIgyGozffipjxYW2KHCSU6toz/view?usp=share_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@H_arcana/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2573003, "client_id": 1122469, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85d0f2dfa6935ac0c1dfcb171ed5d260", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02